# Read automatically by `trivy image` (see the "Security" job's three
# Trivy steps in .github/workflows/ci.yml) -- applies across all three
# scanned images, though in practice only the backend image ships
# starlette.
#
# starlette is pinned to 0.52.1 in backend/requirements.txt (bumped
# from 0.38.6), which already fixes CVE-2024-47874. These two remaining
# findings both require starlette >=1.x, which fastapi 0.141.1 allows,
# but backend/requirements-dev.txt's schemathesis==3.39.16 (used by
# tests/integration/test_api_contract.py) hard-pins `starlette<1`, and
# schemathesis 4.x -- which drops that pin -- requires pytest>=9,
# conflicting with pytest-asyncio==0.24.0. Fixing these two for real
# means migrating the contract-test suite to schemathesis 4.x's new
# Python API (schema loaders moved to schemathesis.openapi.*, config
# object replaces force_schema_version) first. Tracked as follow-up
# work, not a silent skip -- remove these two lines once that
# migration lands and starlette is bumped past 1.3.1.

# SSRF and NTLM credential theft via UNC paths in starlette's
# StaticFiles -- fixed in starlette 1.1.0.
CVE-2026-48818

# starlette request.form() upload-size/field limits silently ignored
# for application/x-www-form-urlencoded bodies, enabling DoS -- fixed
# in starlette 1.3.1.
CVE-2026-54283